<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY SUGAR CONTENT 13.5 PCT AT 4TH TEST.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY SUGAR CONTENT 13.5 PCT AT 4TH TEST.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugar content at Hungary's</p>
<p>fourth beet test of the 1996/97 campaign was down to 13.5</p>
<p>percent from 15.0 percent in the fourth test in last year's</p>
<p>campaign, the Sugar Industry Association (SIA) said on Friday.</p>
<p>						 1996/97     1995/96</p>
<p>Average sugar weight (grams/root)     111.2	   88.65</p>
<p>Sugar content per beet (pct)	     13.5	   15.0</p>
<p>Average weight of roots (grams/root)  824	     591</p>
<p>Average leaf weight (grams/root)	380	     284</p>
<p>The results were based on 224 samples taken on September 9.</p>
<p>The next test results will be released on September 27.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
